# Files that the image build itself owns. The profile meta package (tsx-xx60-console,
# -kiosk or -ha) and the packages it pulls own every other file of the panel.
# profile.sh stage copies only these files. A file here that the profile does
# not have (the profile marker of the ha profile, for example) is not copied.
# Format: image PATH, relative to the root of the image. The build takes the
# file from profiles/NAME/overlay when the profile has its own copy, else from
# rootfs/overlay.
image etc/fstab
image etc/inittab
image etc/tsx/profile
